# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  BYOK — Bring Your Own Keys.   cp .env.example .env   then fill what you need.
#  .env is gitignored and auto-loaded by every parser script (03-parser/common.py).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── TRACK A · OPEN SOURCE / LOCAL ──────────────── NO KEY REQUIRED ────────────
# The fully-free path needs zero keys. Just: ollama pull qwen2.5vl:7b
# Only set this if Ollama runs on another machine (defaults to localhost):
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434

# ── TRACK B · PAID API via OPENROUTER (optional) ──────────────────────────────
# One key, every model. Get one: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Default model is anthropic/claude-sonnet-5 ($2/$10 per 1M, same as first-party).
# Swap it with --model or OPENROUTER_MODEL and re-run the same eval -- that
# comparison is the point of having one harness.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5

# ── TRACK C · FRAMEWORK (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# LlamaParse free tier: https://cloud.llamaindex.ai  →  API Key
# This is the ONLY key Track C needs: stage 2 runs on your local Ollama model by
# default. Set TRACK_C_LLM=anthropic (and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY) only if you want the
# paid extraction path instead.
# LLAMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=llx-...
